  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.19 Harbor master",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.19 “Harbor master” means an individual appointed by the division under RSA 12-G:42, III, who is responsible for the duties described in RSA 12-G:50, III and Pda 402.03, including responsibility for one or more of the harbor areas specified in Pda 402.05.\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; renumbered by #8298 (from Pda 101.16); ss and moved by #8760, eff 11-18-06 (from Pda 101.13)",
